{"id": "DfHzGlGxHer", "title": "Video by astro_zova", "description": "Ravan ne 9 grahon ko kaid kar liya… 😳\nHukm diya: “Sab 11ve ghar mein baitho – mera beta Meghnad amar hoga.”\n\nSab maan gaye. Ek ko chhodkar. 🪐\nShani ne chupke se ek kadam rakh diya — 12va ghar, Vyay ka ghar.\nAur wahi ek kadam, saalon baad, sone ki Lanka jala gaya. 🔥\n\nShani = Shanaishchar = dheere chalne wala.\nEk rashi mein lagbhag dhai saal. Aur 11 December ko Shani margi ho rahe hain.\n\n👇 Tumhari kundli mein Shani kis ghar mein hai? Comment karo — sabse interesting jawab ko agla video milega.\n\nSave karo, us dost ko bhejo jo Saade Saati se darta hai 😅\n\n#ShaniDev #Ravan #Meghnad #Navagraha #Kundli #Astrology #VedicAstrology #ShaniMargi #Jyotish #Ramayan #HinduMythology #ZovaAstrology #Saturn #SadeSati #reelsi̇nstagram", "channel": "astro_zova", "uploader_id": "29969741716", "uploader": "Zova Astro", "timestamp": 1793370602, "like_count": 1421, "comment_count": 6, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1688446502894229a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 50.693, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMiOAVAHPUEfOCdN7FTp4DSLyiekmExM2SpUjuJKZCe3V18vo4d9UaGJLW4bKxgH8W6Yz0wqxlQwUYEzaRNMTadnUb1nSNBpgdJq3w.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdryORAWDyiKeSJb2XwHBqlrm-cCJV49RglLX3nTo4nbEPHtuVsO-LjGq3U6KMmPC3UJ0TRzvrxiW9lmGf523F7Q&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=tTIRvoRISLsQ7kNvwGS5vMO&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=J8YWMulXcH2OV8y1fqlPpg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRFHZAGXvgBOXDpXqsP1GhJ7hHhkPpOFkcrl6sDjLYzNA&oe=6AF42205", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 50.693, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (K